{"version":1,"content":"<p>設計平台Canva發佈了首款由其研究團隊自主研發的圖像生成模型Canva Craft，旨在與谷歌、OpenAI和Meta等公司的同類模型展開競爭。Canva表示，該模型分兩個階段運行。第一階段，模型解讀用户輸入的提示詞，並制定生成計劃，其中包括各元素之間的空間關係、相對比例、視覺層級以及文本生成所需的信息。第二階段，模型根據計劃生成圖像，最高支持2K解像度，並提供多達30種寬高比，以適配不同平台。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583548.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T08:44:12.252446+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":205,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:21:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.520428+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T08:38:07.520428+00:00","content_hash":"9b63fc93c7ef44900ecbd2ff3f55b48c0582de7136bc66a21c686e154f201c67","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}